      "score": 92,
      "summary": "Orders the work correctly: audit, harden, optimize, then polish. It rates the silent save failure P0. Each finding labels its source evidence, separates runtime unknowns, gives a repair and states its own acceptance test. It has a full table of recovery states and uploads that covers object-URL cleanup. Its performance budgets are the most concrete of the three, with retained-heap limits, regression allowances and rollback rules. It reconciles detector signals carefully, though it covers select-all and live-region detail less fully than the other two."
    },
